::: {.cell-output-display}


|                 |                | flagged| not flagged| across the row|
|:----------------|:---------------|-------:|-----------:|--------------:|
|Black defendants |re-arrested     |   1,369|         532|        FNR 28%|
|                 |not re-arrested |     805|         990|        FPR 45%|
