Across a row, conditioning on the truth: $\text{TPR} = P(\hat Y = 1 \mid Y = 1)$, $\;\text{FNR} = 1 - \text{TPR}$, $\;\text{FPR} = P(\hat Y = 1 \mid Y = 0)$.

Of those not re-arrested, 805 of 1,795 Black defendants had been flagged, against 349 of 1,488 white defendants.

::: {.retrieval}
